   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project aims at promoting targeted action research with the ultimate goal of filling gaps in understanding of the reciprocal relationship between HIV/AIDS and food/nutrition insecurity. The project analyses the current and planned policies and programs in terms of their impact on prevention and impact mitigation of HIV and AIDS. National and regional institutions are the key targets.</narrative>
